{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>遊韓必買Isaac Toast靈魂醬汁</p><p>去韓國旅行，不少人都會到人氣吐司店Isaac Toast品嘗招牌早餐。之前品牌曾推出靈魂醬料不過只於海外有售，並未在韓國公開發售，而最近於新世界免稅店指定地點買到，包括仁川國際機場第一航廈出境免稅區以及明洞分店，大家旅行可以買啦！</p><p>仲有3款果醬口味</p><p>除了招牌醬料，Isaac Toast亦推出水蜜桃、蘋果及奇異果三款果醬，果味濃郁，適合配搭麵包、乳酪或甜品食用。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17873070981912323_14739845056a88245cc48d2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178730710265792832_16430966916a882462ae7a9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178730710867013821_482822276a88246704d38.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T10:19:41.362722+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":266,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}